{"version":1,"id":"nf-let-you-down","title":"Let You Down","artist":"NF","key":"Em","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/nf/let-you-down/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Nf and Tommee Profitt","chords":[{"symbol":"A#m","canonical":"A#m","keyboardPitchClasses":[10,1,5],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Fm","canonical":"Fm","keyboardPitchClasses":[5,8,0],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"C#","canonical":"C#","keyboardPitchClasses":[1,5,8],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"lyric","text":"Yeah, I guess I'm a disappointment","columns":34,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#m","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"Doing everything I can, I don't wanna make you disappointed","columns":59,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#","column":48,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"It's annoying","columns":13,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"I just wanna make you feel like everything I ever did wasn't ever tryna make an issue for you","columns":93,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#m","column":49,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Fm","column":83,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"But, I guess the more you","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"Thought about everything, you were never even wrong in the first place, right?","columns":78,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":18,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Fm","column":60,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"Yeah, I'ma just ignore you","columns":26,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"Walking towards you with my head down, lookin' at the ground, I'm embarrassed for you","columns":85,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Fm","column":41,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"Paranoia, what did I do wrong this time? That's parents for you","columns":63,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Fm","column":24,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"Very loyal?","columns":11,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"Shoulda had my back, but you put a knife into my hands before","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":16,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"What else should I carry for you?","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"I cared for you, but","columns":20,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"Yeah, you don't wanna make this work","columns":36,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#m","column":8,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"You just wanna make this worse","columns":30,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"Want me to listen to you","columns":24,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"But you don't ever hear my words","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":28,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"You don't wanna know my hurt yet","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"Let me guess, you want an apology, probably","columns":43,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Fm","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"How can we keep going at a rate like this?","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":12,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"We can't, so I guess I'ma have to leave","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":4,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"Please don't come after me","columns":26,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#m","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"I just wanna be alone right now, I don't really wanna think at all","columns":66,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":16,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"Go ahead, just drink it off","columns":27,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#m","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"Both know you're gonna call tomorrow like nothing's wrong","columns":57,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"Ain't that what you always do?","columns":30,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"I feel like every time I talk to you, you're in an awful mood","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"What else can I offer you?","columns":26,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"There's nothing left right now, I gave it all to you","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":17,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"Yeah, don't talk down to me","columns":27,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#m","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"lyric","text":"That's not gonna work now","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"Packed all my clothes and I moved out","columns":37,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":16,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-33","kind":"lyric","text":"I don't even wanna go to your house","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-34","kind":"lyric","text":"Everytime I sit on that couch","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":13,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-35","kind":"lyric","text":"I feel like you lecture me","columns":26,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":3,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-36","kind":"lyric","text":"Eventually, I bet that we","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":15,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-37","kind":"lyric","text":"Could have made this work","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-38","kind":"lyric","text":"And probably woulda figured things out","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":23,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-39","kind":"lyric","text":"But I guess I'm a letdown","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#m","column":19,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-40","kind":"lyric","text":"But it's cool, I checked out","columns":28,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":18,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-41","kind":"lyric","text":"Oh, you wanna be friends now?","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-42","kind":"lyric","text":"Okay, let's put my fake face on and pretend now","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Fm","column":29,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-43","kind":"lyric","text":"Sit around and talk about the good times","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":31,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-44","kind":"lyric","text":"That didn't even happen","columns":23,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":19,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-45","kind":"lyric","text":"I mean, why are you laughing?","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-46","kind":"lyric","text":"Must have missed that joke","columns":26,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":10,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-47","kind":"lyric","text":"Let me see if I can find a reaction","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":28,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-48","kind":"lyric","text":"No, but at least you're happy","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-49","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm sorry","columns":9,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Fm","column":5,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-50","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm so sorry now","columns":16,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Fm","column":7,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-51","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm sorry","columns":9,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Fm","column":5,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-52","kind":"lyric","text":"That I let you down","columns":19,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Fm","column":17,"beat":2}]}]}